{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And a priest's daughter.</b> Why do I need <b>and a priest's daughter</b> twice? Rather, <b>when she becomes wife to a foreign man</b> — that is, one who had relations with her disqualifying her, so that she became disqualified through him, as is taught in Yevamot, chapter HaAlmanah laKohen Gadol. Since she had relations with one who disqualifies her, she may not eat of the terumah of sacred donations."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:14:18.432163014Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}